ply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misosuggestionchip","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOSuggestionChip","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOSuggestionChip","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip","type":"topic"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents","type":"topic","role":"collection","images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"}],"title":"Components"}}}